          <mdui:DisplayName xml:lang="en">NgREN eduMEET Federation Gateway</mdui:DisplayName>
          <mdui:Description xml:lang="en">NgREN eduMEET is a national video-conferencing and virtual collaboration service provided by the Nigerian Research and Education Network (NgREN) for education and research institutions in Nigeria. It enables institutions to conduct secure online meetings, virtual classes, webinars, presentations, and collaborative sessions through a web browser, with integration into the NgREN federated identity infrastructure for institutional single sign-on.</mdui:Description>
